# <%= current_page.data.title %>

## What it is

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| VM | `MPDIMZXHBT01.cp.cjs.hmcts.net` — RHEL 7.4 (2018 image), `Standard_DS2_v2`, no zone |
| IP / subnet | 10.200.65.36 · `SN-MPD-IMZ-XHBIT-FTP-01` · NSG `NS-MPD-IMZ-FTPS-INNER` |
| Role | `ccm_libra_gateway` — XHIBIT file gateway (HTTPS for CP; SFTP for BAIS) |
| XHIBIT side | File transfer through **BAIS** (HMCTS Azure, 10.24.251.12 / .14) over SFTP via Cloud Gateway. The XHIBIT application servers don't connect to CP directly |

## What it's used for

Court list / hearing data exchange between CP (hearing, listing, hearingnows services) and XHIBIT.

## Network flow

`MPDIMZXHBT01` is a file drop between the two sides. CP reads and writes files over HTTPS; BAIS connects in over SFTP to collect and deliver files for XHIBIT.

**A. CP side — CP services ↔ XHIBIT gateway (HTTPS 443)**

```
┌─ Crime Live tenant (CP) ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. CP AKS pods — hearing, listing, hearingnows (10.232.x)              │
│      │  HTTPS 443                                                      │
│      │  • writes to   /xhibit-gateway/send-to-xhibit/                  │
│      │  • reads from  /xhibit-gateway/received-from-xhibit/            │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 2. MPDIMZXHBT01 (10.200.65.36)                                         │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**B. XHIBIT side — BAIS ↔ XHIBIT gateway (SFTP 22)**

```
┌─ HMCTS Azure (BAIS) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. BAIS file transfer service (10.24.251.12 / .14)                     │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║
┌──────▼─ Cloud Gateway (third party) ───────────────────────────────────┐
│ 2. Firewall rule "BAIS LIVE Outbound AZ-CPP" — NAT to Xhibit DSS VIP   │
└──────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
       ║  IPsec tunnel (LEG-CGI / LEG-CGI-DR)
┌──────▼─ Crime Live tenant (CP) ────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 3. VG-MPD-OLDAZURE-01 (VPN gateway)                                    │
│      ▼                                                                 │
│ 4. MPDIMZXHBT01 :22 (SFTP, user xhbt)                                  │
│      • collects files from  send-to-xhibit/                            │
│      • delivers files to    received-from-xhibit/                      │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## How it's managed

| Item | Detail |
|---|---|
| VM IaC | `hmcts/cpp-automation-terraform` → `environments/live/mpd/integration_dmz/60-virtual_machines.tf` |
| Config | Ansible `sp-ansible/xhbt_sftp_lv_setup.yml` (`automation.ansible`, `rota-automation-ansible`) |
| Secrets | Vault `secret/mpd/imz/xhbt_gateway_ftpuser_authkeys` |
| App config | `cpp-aks-deploy` `prd/{hearing,listing,hearingnows}-service_values.yaml.j2`<br>`cpp-automation-ansible` `inventory/group_vars/environment_ccm_prd/all.yml` |
| Backup | ✅ Daily 02:30, 30-day retention, GRS. Cross-region restore **disabled** |
| Monitoring | Zabbix, OMS agent |

## Risks

- Single VM, RHEL 7.4.
- NSG allows 443 / 21 / 990 from `*`.
- SFTP `Match Group xhbt` allows password auth.

## Improvements / future

- Tighten the NSG.
- Key-only SFTP.
- Enable cross-region restore.
- If XHIBIT is long-lived: consider a managed replacement (e.g. Azure Storage SFTP + private endpoint).
